{"3781570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Death In Wild West", "steam_appid": 3781570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“No Death in Wild West” invites you into the dangerous and opportunity-filled wilderness of the West. Race against time to complete missions, escape disasters, acquire powerful skills, collect gold coins, and achieve time-limited objectives. Craft your own unique ability builds, push your speed to the limit, and set ever-faster records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/4698da7ab1f5d10305204ff72e9d359a.poster.avif?t=1781775949\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/4698da7ab1f5d10305204ff72e9d359a.webm?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/4698da7ab1f5d10305204ff72e9d359a.mp4?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you escape before the apocalypse?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Time is your greatest enemy】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is your greatest enemy. Push forward in intense time-limited challenges, complete missions, and fight to survive. As time advances, enemies grow more lethal and the environment becomes increasingly unforgiving. Only those who master both speed and skill will make it to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/540f4072b7e11094276f40b706320525.poster.avif?t=1781775949\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/540f4072b7e11094276f40b706320525.webm?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/540f4072b7e11094276f40b706320525.mp4?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Build Your Own Hero】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character, upgrade your abilities, unlock new skills, and combine powerful item effects to create insane synergies. Whether you prefer high-speed dashes, precision shooting, or agile dodging, you’ll find a combat style that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/1775f124b34d3e33fd81ec2ce77ce722.poster.avif?t=1781775949\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/1775f124b34d3e33fd81ec2ce77ce722.webm?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/1775f124b34d3e33fd81ec2ce77ce722.mp4?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Bullets vs. Speed】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use dashes, slides, and special abilities to dodge enemy fire, pulling off heart-stopping dodges at the very last second. Master the rhythm, break through wave after wave of enemies, and experience the exhilarating thrill of high-speed movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/324ff49395f6cfc140023696c5a9a1a4.poster.avif?t=1781775949\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/324ff49395f6cfc140023696c5a9a1a4.webm?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/324ff49395f6cfc140023696c5a9a1a4.mp4?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【Rich Scenes &amp; Dynamic Levels】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast desert canyons, traverse cursed forests, race across red-soil wastelands, and even storm the divine realms of the heavens. Each environment features unique map mechanics, enemy types, and special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/a2c13fa1719e8d080c40a58ea45d363b.poster.avif?t=1781775949\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/a2c13fa1719e8d080c40a58ea45d363b.webm?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/a2c13fa1719e8d080c40a58ea45d363b.mp4?t=1781775949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There's a snake in my boot!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wild West is packed with excitement and breakneck pacing. Experience intense one-against-many battles, push forward in time-attack challenges, compete with players around the world, and strive for the fastest completion times and highest scores!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“No Death in Wild West” invites you into the dangerous and opportunity-filled wilderness of the West. Race against time to complete missions, escape disasters, acquire powerful skills, collect gold coins, and achieve time-limited objectives. Craft your own unique ability builds, push your speed